{"kind": "mod", "id": 2423, "name": "C11 - True North", "slug": "c11-true-north", "teaser": "New guns and parts from foreign lands", "owner_name": "bobinstien", "downloads": 39449, "favourites": 50, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.c11.truenorth4", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Weapons", "category_id": 13, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:13:45.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-11-05T15:44:15.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-11-05T15:20:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.13", "latest_version": "3.1.5", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<hr />\n<h1>🇨🇦 True North 🇨🇦</h1>\n<hr />\n<p>Welcome to the <strong>True North</strong></p>\n<p>Juicy Trudy from Canmore has gotten a hold of some fancy contraband from his last fishing trip and he’s trying to offload it on the cheap.<br />\nHe’s also recently purchased a Dremel from Canadian Tire and has a few new parts for you to try out.</p>\n<p>To unlock the trader, you must complete the quest “Oh, Canada?” from Peacekeeper.</p>\n<p><em>huge shoutout to EpicRangeTime for making the shaders that I use in this mod, go check out his work as well.</em></p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>To install, unzip and drop the <code>SPT</code> folder into your SPT install location.</p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Pistols</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Strike Industries Strike 80 (Tan) with Killer Industries Slide, Barrel and Comp, and ETS Transparent Mag</strong></p>\n<p>Comes with Killer Industries Slide, Barrel and Comp, and ETS Transparent Mag</p>\n<p>Available from Mechanic (LL3).</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nNq55cWG/Strike-Industries-Strike-80-Frame-Black-w-KI-Internals-2026-02-18-13-24-20.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/ycmbby39\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Glock 34</strong></p>\n<p>Slide, regular barrel and threaded barrel for the Glock 17 Frame.</p>\n<p>Available from Mechanic (LL2).</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Kp5rXYK5/Glock-17-9x19-pistol-Glock-34-2026-02-18-13-27-23.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/hJgmykYg\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Heckler &amp; Koch P30</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rfGNwJZ4/Heckler-Koch-P30-Pistol-2026-02-21-17-08-04.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/DgDTRn75\" /></p>\n<p>Concealable German Excellence.</p>\n<p>Available from Peacekeeper (LL2 for $, LL1 for trade).</p>\n<p><strong>Heckler &amp; Koch P30L</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rfyKX7QM/Heckler-Koch-P30-L-9x19-pistol-mr-wick-2026-02-21-17-07-40.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/93Ymd8p2\" /></p>\n<p>Hello Again Mr. Wick.</p>\n<p>Available from Peacekeeper (LL3)</p>\n<p><strong>Agency Arms Glock 17 LS</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3yMJ0gcS/Glock-17-9x19-pistol-2026-02-21-17-07-14.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/XZ3wzctF\" /></p>\n<p>You’ve upgraded, Mr. Wick</p>\n<p>Available from Mechanic (LL3).</p>\n<p><strong>Ruger Mark IV 22/45</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YqfXKcR/Ruger-Mark-IV-2245-2026-02-21-17-11-32.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/dzkt3PW\" /></p>\n<p>Classic American Plinking</p>\n<p>Available from Skier (LL1)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Assault Rifles</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>VZ-58</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TD99XxJX/Sa-vz-58-7-62x39-7-Inch-assault-rifle-2026-04-30-07-59-17.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/6cjjh7Gh\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yFK4BGpS/Sa-vz-58-7-62x39-assault-rifle-2026-04-30-07-57-10.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/wh8cr37s\" /></p>\n<p>Available in long and short barrels for 7.62x39 and long barrel 5.56x45</p>\n<p><strong>Galil Ace 32</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GvH0wJfx/IWI-Galil-ACE-32-2026-02-21-17-08-17.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/WWV693Nx\" /></p>\n<p>Available from Mechanic (LL3).</p>\n<p><strong>Galil Ace 31</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HTX0mhQ3/IWI-Galil-ACE-31-7-62x39-assault-rifle-2026-02-21-17-10-34.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/d47Snmyx\" /></p>\n<p>Available from Mechanic (LL3).</p>\n<p><strong>Armalite AR-18</strong></p>\n<p>Multiple Variants, Available from Skier (LL1).</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qMs9h0xn/Armalite-AR-18-2026-02-18-13-29-10.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/BVZjv4wP\" /></p>\n<p><strong>CMMG AR-15 .22LR Conversion Kit</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bgMYgfLs/CMMG-AR-15-22-LR-25-round-magazine-2026-04-30-07-40-49.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/N6df64p9\" /></p>\n<p>Includes mag, lower and .22lr specific barrel.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Carbines</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>American 180 (.22LR)</strong></p>\n<p>A swarm of angry bees in the form of a firearm.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/R46FW3N1/American-180-22-LR-Submachine-Gun-2026-02-21-17-06-37.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/h1d6vBck\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Poly Technologies Type 81 SE (Crimson Red)</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jvkBH5fG/Poly-Technologies-Type-81-Special-Edition-Red-2026-02-20-16-12-24.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/0jy8QX2Z\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Aero Precision M5 .308</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/XxYnG2wF/Aero-Precision-M5-7-62x51-2026-04-30-07-47-57.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/tpL01mdY\" /></p>\n<p>Has black and camo variants</p>\n<p><strong>Norinco SKS-D</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PZ1rjzqx/Norinco-SKS-D-7-62x39-2026-04-30-07-43-10.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/4Z4FtghW\" /></p>\n<p>SKS that takes AK mags</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Bolt Actions</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Brugger and Thomet SPR .300</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6RZmXQWQ/B-T-SPR300-2026-02-21-17-09-38.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/pvPxhqLq\" /></p>\n<p><strong>McMillan CS5 .308</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/N6z1YqTz/Mc-Millan-CS5-Stubby-Receiver-2026-04-30-07-42-23.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/6R5vsSX5\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">LMGs</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Ultimax 100</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ynMcdSjB/STK-Ultimax-100-5-56x45-Light-Machine-Gun-U100-2026-02-18-13-23-26.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/Gv14nTS3\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Poly Technologies Type 81 LMG</strong></p>\n<p>Keep your eyes out for a boss variant</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PGnH4PYb/Poly-Technologies-Type-81-LMG-2026-04-30-07-55-03.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/CKZGvYtX\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Helmets and Accessories</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Ops-Core FAST SF Helmet</strong></p>\n<p>Some spicy boss variants as well</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RkzbmnVN/Ops-Core-FAST-NGH-ballistic-helmet-AOR1-2026-02-20-17-15-05.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/q3kjfGPC\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v6byMX54/Ops-Core-FAST-NGH-ballistic-helmet-CADPAT-2026-02-20-17-14-45.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/wFTG2cHh\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Wvy0nv5r/Ops-Core-FAST-NGH-ballistic-helmet-AOR1-2026-04-30-07-53-03.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/0yMKqy20\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WvM0DJ8H/Ops-Core-FAST-NGH-ballistic-helmet-AOR2-2026-04-30-07-53-38.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/SwMcQCY6\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tT7N2W0B/Ops-Core-FAST-SF-Helmet-GB-2026-04-30-07-51-21.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/5gNzjfQT\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tM59Wvhd/Ops-Core-AMP-Arms-2026-04-30-07-47-08.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/pvpS9MPm\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-7\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Night Vision</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>ACTinBlack DTNVS Dual Tactical Night Vision System</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nsY3dzr7/ACTin-Black-DTNVS-Dual-Tactical-Night-Vision-System-2026-04-23-17-09-13.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/qMc0qkBN\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Argus Chimera Panoramic Bridge Quad’s</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/996G95x2/Argus-Chimera-Panoramic-Bridge-Multi-Cam-Alpine-2026-04-23-17-08-44.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/XZ1VZRnp\" /></p>\n<p>Available in tan and some secret colors</p>\n<p><strong>ITT ANPVS-5-A Gen 2 Night Vision System</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/j9379LRZ/ITT-ANPVS-5-A-Night-Vision-Goggles-2026-04-23-17-09-03.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/qLmbLR5F\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-8\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Armour</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Spiritus Systems LV-119</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZpjZXLFP/LV119-Covert-Multicam-Tropic-2026-02-18-13-34-01.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/gL2n9jfp\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Ferro Concepts Slickster KTAR</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HLkh36yP/Ferro-Concepts-Slickster-Plate-Carrier-w-KTAR-Flap-Multicam-2026-02-21-17-09-56.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/zW06Dpg2\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Ferro Concepts Slickster Slick</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DP24nWHD/Ferro-Concepts-Slickster-Plate-Carrier-Multicam-2026-04-30-07-49-12.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/TD3c52xB\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Ferro Concepts FCPC V5 AOR2 Breacher</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rKbg6npV/Ferro-Concepts-FCPC-V5-Plate-Carrier-AOR2-2026-04-30-07-49-29.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/Fks9wGYF\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-9\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Weapon Parts &amp; Sights</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>PPSH Tactical Upgrade Kit</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xK2g5Jqn/PPSh-41-7-62x25-submachine-gun-2026-02-20-16-13-42.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/rKQpy42B\" /></p>\n<p>Available at Prapor (LL1)</p>\n<p><strong>Delta Point Micro Glock Red Dot</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/hRkVrVB4/Delta-Point-Micro-Glock-2026-04-30-07-47-36.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/gMGJQJSf\" /></p>\n<p><strong>ZenitCo VZOR4 Red Dot with Laser and Illuminator</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7JHN7Y9V/Zenit-Co-Vzor-4-Sight-Laser-Illuminator-Combo-2026-04-30-07-47-24.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/TBZqzvCR\" /></p>\n<p>Works the same as the Wilcox XeBoss, use the change reticle button to turn on the laser. Has Vis/IR/Illum</p>\n<p><strong>MFMD 5.56 Muzzle Device</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/W4htc3Tz/MFMD-5-56-1-3-MD-12-X28-Suppressor-Black-2026-04-30-07-46-53.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/393z0sJF\" /></p>\n<p>Comes in Black and Tan</p>\n<p><strong>PIECE OF MIND X ILLICIT PROVISIONS Multicam Alpine Windowed PMAG</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/C5kpGxZc/PIECE-OF-MIND-X-ILLICIT-PROVISIONS-MULTICAM-ALPINE-Magpul-30-Round-Magazine-2026-04-30-07-46-30.png\" alt=\"url=https://ibb.co/gM5bKsp2\" /></p></div></div></div>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> Please let me know if there is any issues, and log files of the issues would be wonderful</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.11.4", "content_length": null, "downloads": 114, "published_at": "2025-11-05T18:35:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2423/c11-true-north/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.11.4", "content_length": null, "downloads": 150, "published_at": "2025-11-06T00:09:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2423/c11-true-north/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.11.4", "content_length": null, "downloads": 267, "published_at": "2025-11-06T21:33:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2423/c11-true-north/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 168, "published_at": "2025-11-06T21:51:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2423/c11-true-north/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "extern